flypage (0.1.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Build on a clean system: add python3-gi-cairo to the build
    dependencies, and skip the window tests when GTK 4 is not installed.
  * GitHub Actions workflow: build, test and lintian on every push; a
    pushed vX.Y.Z tag publishes a GitHub release with the .deb.

